# Chandra, Spark Hunter's -7: "You get an emblem with 'Whenever an artifact you control enters, this emblem deals 3 damage to any
# target.'" Chandra is cast on turn 1 (4), raised by +2 on turns 1 and 3 (8), and uses -7 on turn 5, going to 1 loyalty and
# staying on the battlefield. Bot1 then casts Mox Jet and Mox Emerald, one trigger each, and both hit Bot2 (20 to 17 to 14).
# On Bot2's turn 6 Bot2 casts Mox Ruby: an artifact, but not one Bot1 controls, so the emblem does not trigger (no target is
# asked of Bot1 and Bot1 loses nothing). The emblem is in the command zone, and the emblem's damage comes from it.

